    "prep_ahead_note": {
      "original": "Saffron sauce and sauteed vegetables can be made ahead. Vegetables need minimum 2 hours marinating.",
      "original_lang": "en",
      "translation": "藏红花酱和炒蔬菜可提前做。蔬菜需至少腌制 2 小时。",
